1
00:00:08,044 --> 00:00:09,594
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,969 --> 00:00:12,119
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:14,894 --> 00:00:17,803
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,369 --> 00:00:22,350
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,744 --> 00:00:28,248
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,248 --> 00:00:30,488
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,494 --> 00:00:35,384
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,069 --> 00:00:39,717
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,344 --> 00:00:44,120
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,819 --> 00:00:49,294
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,294 --> 00:00:52,942
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,744 --> 00:00:58,251
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,251 --> 00:01:01,899
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,378 --> 00:01:09,335
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,167 --> 00:01:15,687
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,687 --> 00:01:18,361
=Episode 20=

17
00:01:25,738 --> 00:01:26,417
There she is.

18
00:01:32,217 --> 00:01:33,343
Dongshan Tai has someone

19
00:01:33,344 --> 00:01:34,658
like her working for him?

20
00:01:41,018 --> 00:01:41,538
Lin.

21
00:01:42,777 --> 00:01:43,697
Hutou Jun was also

22
00:01:43,697 --> 00:01:45,018
killed with a bolt like that.

23
00:01:55,577 --> 00:01:57,098
She's really good.

24
00:02:10,498 --> 00:02:12,378
That means the night we fought

25
00:02:12,778 --> 00:02:13,778
Nanhu Gang

26
00:02:14,137 --> 00:02:16,017
was probably set up by Dongshan Tai.

27
00:02:17,417 --> 00:02:19,378
He wanted Nanhu Gang's territory,

28
00:02:20,378 --> 00:02:21,577
so he framed Boss Hui,

29
00:02:21,857 --> 00:02:23,297
then tried to become the shot-caller.

30
00:02:30,381 --> 00:02:30,778
She's leaving.

31
00:02:31,378 --> 00:02:31,857
Follow her.

32
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:46,504
(Guanyin Temple)

33
00:02:46,978 --> 00:02:48,017
Where's the woman in leather?

34
00:02:51,137 --> 00:02:52,658
Did you lose her?

35
00:02:53,177 --> 00:02:55,218
This is on you. You drove too slow.

36
00:02:55,658 --> 00:02:56,617
It's fine.

37
00:02:59,177 --> 00:03:01,017
They're not hauling seafood, are they?

38
00:03:01,737 --> 00:03:02,617
Doesn't look like it.

39
00:03:03,498 --> 00:03:04,137
It's too light.

40
00:03:04,938 --> 00:03:05,752
- Don't.
- Why don't you leave?

41
00:03:07,617 --> 00:03:08,017
Fine. You go.

42
00:03:08,498 --> 00:03:08,818
I'm leaving.

43
00:04:45,578 --> 00:04:46,978
This has to be the place.

44
00:04:51,148 --> 00:04:53,028
This could be bait from Dongshan Tai.

45
00:04:53,578 --> 00:04:54,658
If we go in,

46
00:04:54,658 --> 00:04:55,617
we need to be careful.

47
00:05:00,218 --> 00:05:01,177
What are you doing here?

48
00:05:08,138 --> 00:05:09,698
So Dongshan Tai hid the drugs here.

49
00:05:10,497 --> 00:05:10,914
Don't move.

50
00:05:14,432 --> 00:05:15,992
Hiding drugs in a sacred place?

51
00:05:16,953 --> 00:05:17,872
That's bad karma.

52
00:05:18,464 --> 00:05:20,024
I don't care about karma.

53
00:05:20,538 --> 00:05:21,458
Now that you know,

54
00:05:21,737 --> 00:05:22,937
you're not leaving here today.

55
00:05:23,297 --> 00:05:24,737
You'd attack us before the gods?

56
00:05:25,377 --> 00:05:25,898
What?

57
00:05:26,218 --> 00:05:27,018
Try me.

58
00:05:31,627 --> 00:05:35,175
(Guanyin Temple)

59
00:05:36,578 --> 00:05:37,377
Police! Don't move!

60
00:05:37,538 --> 00:05:38,218
Hands on your heads!

61
00:05:38,218 --> 00:05:38,698
Don't move!

62
00:05:39,218 --> 00:05:39,737
Get down!

63
00:05:40,218 --> 00:05:40,737
Get down!

64
00:05:45,862 --> 00:05:46,937
Shen Yanlin.

65
00:05:47,817 --> 00:05:48,698
You called the police?

66
00:05:48,817 --> 00:05:49,664
Yes, Officer Luo.

67
00:05:50,538 --> 00:05:51,098
I called the police.

68
00:05:51,297 --> 00:05:51,947
It was me.

69
00:05:57,817 --> 00:05:58,297
Officer Luo.

70
00:06:00,417 --> 00:06:01,078
We meet again.

71
00:06:02,677 --> 00:06:03,518
Take them all in.

72
00:06:04,102 --> 00:06:04,607
Move.

73
00:06:05,136 --> 00:06:05,584
Hands!

74
00:06:06,778 --> 00:06:07,297
Behave yourself.

75
00:06:08,173 --> 00:06:08,578
Move!

76
00:06:10,075 --> 00:06:10,779
Back up.

77
00:06:11,018 --> 00:06:11,377
Move!

78
00:06:30,805 --> 00:06:33,377
(Guanyin Temple)

79
00:06:33,377 --> 00:06:34,218
Move! Move!

80
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:40,000
(Guanyin Temple)

81
00:06:43,297 --> 00:06:45,297
How did the cops find Guanyin Temple?

82
00:06:46,098 --> 00:06:46,725
Everyone

83
00:06:47,098 --> 00:06:47,898
except me

84
00:06:48,377 --> 00:06:49,297
was taken into custody.

85
00:06:50,617 --> 00:06:52,138
They'll trace it back here soon.

86
00:06:52,817 --> 00:06:53,937
We can still leave now.

87
00:06:54,978 --> 00:06:56,978
And we have no drugs to distribute.

88
00:06:57,218 --> 00:06:58,698
The distributors who already paid us

89
00:06:58,698 --> 00:07:00,018
won't let this go either.

90
00:07:00,497 --> 00:07:01,098
Boss Tai.

91
00:07:01,458 --> 00:07:02,778
There's no time to hesitate.

92
00:07:06,417 --> 00:07:07,898
I'm this close.

93
00:07:09,937 --> 00:07:10,856
Why?

94
00:07:27,294 --> 00:07:30,501
(Dongcheng Gang Headquarters)

95
00:07:30,698 --> 00:07:31,658
Gentlemen.

96
00:07:33,018 --> 00:07:34,160
Dongshan Tai used

97
00:07:34,161 --> 00:07:36,218
Fei Liu's shipping route to move drugs.

98
00:07:37,705 --> 00:07:38,698
(Loyalty Hall)

99
00:07:38,698 --> 00:07:39,737
To distribute them,

100
00:07:40,177 --> 00:07:41,538
he set his sights
on my entertainment club

101
00:07:41,817 --> 00:07:42,898
and deliberately caused trouble

102
00:07:43,778 --> 00:07:45,617
so he could take it from me.

103
00:07:49,018 --> 00:07:50,377
Once the operation was up and running,

104
00:07:52,817 --> 00:07:54,177
he feared being exposed,

105
00:07:54,817 --> 00:07:56,098
so he killed Fei Liu

106
00:07:56,817 --> 00:07:57,578
and Bao Zun.

107
00:07:58,937 --> 00:08:00,937
Ever since Tai joined Dongcheng Gang,

108
00:08:00,937 --> 00:08:02,617
he's always been humble and polite.

109
00:08:03,377 --> 00:08:05,377
How could he be dealing drugs?

110
00:08:06,177 --> 00:08:07,507
And how could he

111
00:08:08,817 --> 00:08:10,271
have killed Bao Zun

112
00:08:10,658 --> 00:08:11,699
and Fei Liu?

113
00:08:12,098 --> 00:08:13,778
You never know what someone's like.

114
00:08:15,578 --> 00:08:16,978
He acted like he wanted nothing.

115
00:08:17,877 --> 00:08:18,317
Otherwise,

116
00:08:19,338 --> 00:08:20,698
how could he have fooled us?

117
00:08:21,578 --> 00:08:22,578
Looking at it now,

118
00:08:23,817 --> 00:08:24,658
what happened to Hui

119
00:08:25,348 --> 00:08:25,898
might

120
00:08:26,538 --> 00:08:27,522
have been his doing too.

121
00:08:36,978 --> 00:08:38,058
Officer Luo, we found something.

122
00:08:41,737 --> 00:08:42,777
Take them all in.

123
00:08:43,338 --> 00:08:43,818
Yes.

124
00:08:44,418 --> 00:08:44,938
Take them away.

125
00:08:46,298 --> 00:08:47,338
Get up. Move.

126
00:08:47,537 --> 00:08:47,938
Move.

127
00:08:50,410 --> 00:08:53,098
(Loyalty Hall)

128
00:08:53,098 --> 00:08:55,657
The cops sealed off Tai's warehouse,

129
00:08:56,098 --> 00:08:57,458
and now he's fled.

130
00:08:57,938 --> 00:09:00,377
So he can't challenge you

131
00:09:00,818 --> 00:09:01,617
for the shot-caller position.

132
00:09:02,058 --> 00:09:02,978
Why not just

133
00:09:03,578 --> 00:09:04,737
leave him to his fate?

134
00:09:05,578 --> 00:09:07,218
Because his warehouse was sealed,

135
00:09:07,638 --> 00:09:10,077
we need to find him before the cops do.

136
00:09:12,208 --> 00:09:14,458
We're all brothers in the gang.

137
00:09:15,298 --> 00:09:16,578
Do we really need

138
00:09:16,938 --> 00:09:18,058
to go this far?

139
00:09:18,657 --> 00:09:19,497
Mr. Mai Gao.

140
00:09:20,578 --> 00:09:21,818
I'm doing this for the company.

141
00:09:22,377 --> 00:09:23,818
That's why we need to find Tai.

142
00:09:25,178 --> 00:09:27,178
The cops arrested so many people.

143
00:09:27,897 --> 00:09:29,818
It's only a matter of time

144
00:09:30,777 --> 00:09:32,458
before he's wanted by the police.

145
00:09:33,218 --> 00:09:35,098
Will he expose the company?

146
00:09:35,418 --> 00:09:38,137
Will he expose all of you?

147
00:09:39,098 --> 00:09:39,897
Would you bet on it?

148
00:09:52,978 --> 00:09:53,257
Officer Luo.

149
00:09:53,657 --> 00:09:54,257
They confessed.

150
00:09:54,537 --> 00:09:55,338
It was Dongshan Tai.

151
00:09:56,178 --> 00:09:57,938
Any word on him?

152
00:09:58,137 --> 00:09:59,497
All routes out are blocked.

153
00:09:59,857 --> 00:10:00,657
He can't get out of Shicheng.

154
00:10:00,897 --> 00:10:01,777
(Shicheng Royal Police Headquarters)
Send more men.

155
00:10:02,137 --> 00:10:03,152
Search all of Shicheng.

156
00:10:03,153 --> 00:10:04,338
Find him no matter what.

157
00:10:04,338 --> 00:10:04,818
Yes.

158
00:10:05,578 --> 00:10:06,058
Boss Che.

159
00:10:07,418 --> 00:10:07,857
Look.

160
00:10:09,298 --> 00:10:10,497
Isn't that Dongshan Tai?

161
00:10:14,338 --> 00:10:15,137
What does it say?

162
00:10:15,653 --> 00:10:16,978
(Shicheng Evening News
Police Hunt Dongshan Tai)

163
00:10:16,978 --> 00:10:18,298
Shicheng Royal Police

164
00:10:18,299 --> 00:10:20,058
issued a warrant today

165
00:10:20,537 --> 00:10:22,295
for gang leader Dongshan Tai,

166
00:10:24,537 --> 00:10:25,578
whose real name is Chen Jiatai,

167
00:10:25,578 --> 00:10:26,708
alias Dongshan Tai.

168
00:10:26,938 --> 00:10:28,996
He's wanted for drug trafficking,

169
00:10:28,996 --> 00:10:30,897
murder, and other serious crimes.

170
00:10:31,698 --> 00:10:32,698
He remains at large.

171
00:10:39,298 --> 00:10:40,178
By the way, Boss Che.

172
00:10:43,617 --> 00:10:44,298
This

173
00:10:45,617 --> 00:10:47,253
is what I got at Guanyin Temple.

174
00:10:47,978 --> 00:10:48,617
It's for protection.

175
00:10:53,446 --> 00:10:55,222
Since when do you believe in this stuff?

176
00:10:57,897 --> 00:10:59,218
Boss Hui and my brother both...

177
00:11:03,822 --> 00:11:04,383
So,

178
00:11:04,897 --> 00:11:06,218
I don't want to lose you too.

179
00:11:13,017 --> 00:11:13,463
Thanks.

180
00:11:18,338 --> 00:11:18,893
Boss Lin.

181
00:11:19,978 --> 00:11:20,777
We got a lead.

182
00:11:21,797 --> 00:11:22,338
Go on.

183
00:11:22,338 --> 00:11:23,497
Someone saw Dongshan Tai's car

184
00:11:23,603 --> 00:11:24,684
heading toward Fei Liu's place.

185
00:11:25,698 --> 00:11:26,178
Fei Liu's place?

186
00:11:29,338 --> 00:11:30,338
He's trying to leave by sea.

187
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:37,360
(Yongxing Street)

188
00:12:07,810 --> 00:12:11,494
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant Menu)

189
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:36,240
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant Menu)

190
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:39,480
(Rongxing Braised Goose Liver
20 slices, 30 skewers, 20:30)

191
00:12:39,897 --> 00:12:40,737
We searched

192
00:12:40,737 --> 00:12:41,737
all of Fei Liu's docks,

193
00:12:42,298 --> 00:12:43,897
but still no sign of Dongshan Tai.

194
00:12:50,818 --> 00:12:52,617
Dongcheng Gang is looking for him too.

195
00:12:54,338 --> 00:12:55,497
They may try to silence him.

196
00:12:56,777 --> 00:12:57,698
Wait.

197
00:12:59,418 --> 00:13:02,257
Does Dongcheng Gang want him dead,

198
00:13:02,578 --> 00:13:04,458
or does Shen Yanlin?

199
00:13:08,418 --> 00:13:09,657
Dongshan Tai also has

200
00:13:09,657 --> 00:13:11,178
a lot of evidence against the gang.

201
00:13:12,377 --> 00:13:13,458
We need to find him first.

202
00:13:15,218 --> 00:13:17,137
We've checked every hotel and venue

203
00:13:17,137 --> 00:13:18,698
in Dongcheng.

204
00:13:18,938 --> 00:13:20,657
There's still no sign of him.

205
00:13:21,298 --> 00:13:22,058
But our men

206
00:13:22,418 --> 00:13:23,737
found a suspicious vehicle

207
00:13:23,737 --> 00:13:24,897
on Lika Road in the north.

208
00:13:25,978 --> 00:13:27,178
It's a smuggled car.

209
00:13:27,818 --> 00:13:29,737
The tire tracks match

210
00:13:30,017 --> 00:13:31,377
a car registered to Bao Zun.

211
00:13:34,298 --> 00:13:35,616
Lika Road in the north...

212
00:13:37,298 --> 00:13:38,458
That's not far from the port.

213
00:13:39,938 --> 00:13:40,818
We've blocked

214
00:13:40,818 --> 00:13:42,137
every road out of the port.

215
00:13:43,098 --> 00:13:45,497
But the sea routes are hard to control.

216
00:13:45,954 --> 00:13:46,554
So,

217
00:13:47,418 --> 00:13:49,458
Tai may still try to escape by sea.

218
00:13:50,777 --> 00:13:51,413
It's possible.

219
00:14:08,497 --> 00:14:10,497
Send men to Lika Road in the north.

220
00:14:11,338 --> 00:14:12,218
Aside from the hotels,

221
00:14:13,298 --> 00:14:15,657
search every place he could hide.

222
00:14:24,178 --> 00:14:24,978
Boss Tai.

223
00:14:25,617 --> 00:14:27,818
Everything's set with the smuggler.

224
00:14:28,978 --> 00:14:29,897
We should get going.

225
00:14:40,298 --> 00:14:40,777
Su.

226
00:14:41,857 --> 00:14:42,458
Keep your back to me.

227
00:14:43,578 --> 00:14:44,418
Just stand there.

228
00:14:45,777 --> 00:14:46,777
I need to tell you something.

229
00:14:51,578 --> 00:14:53,098
You must hate me.

230
00:14:54,418 --> 00:14:55,617
Whether you believe me or not,

231
00:14:58,098 --> 00:14:59,098
over the years,

232
00:14:59,818 --> 00:15:01,578
I've thought about abandoning

233
00:15:02,617 --> 00:15:03,777
you, my own daughter.

234
00:15:06,578 --> 00:15:07,698
But I didn't.

235
00:15:08,418 --> 00:15:09,298
Your mother

236
00:15:10,298 --> 00:15:11,617
was a nightclub

237
00:15:13,978 --> 00:15:14,657
hostess.

238
00:15:21,418 --> 00:15:22,777
The gang was so big.

239
00:15:23,497 --> 00:15:24,617
(Survival)
I always thought

240
00:15:27,978 --> 00:15:30,137
the others would use that

241
00:15:30,458 --> 00:15:31,098
against me

242
00:15:31,698 --> 00:15:32,578
to give me a hard time.

243
00:15:34,777 --> 00:15:35,698
Come to think of it,

244
00:15:39,178 --> 00:15:41,737
I had no right to look down on her.

245
00:15:45,377 --> 00:15:48,402
Back then, I was a street punk,

246
00:15:49,218 --> 00:15:52,218
and no headquarters

247
00:15:52,218 --> 00:15:53,978
would take me in.

248
00:15:55,777 --> 00:15:56,698
Back then,

249
00:15:58,777 --> 00:15:59,698
I was kind...

250
00:16:02,377 --> 00:16:03,178
and quiet.

251
00:16:04,578 --> 00:16:06,218
Until one day,

252
00:16:11,497 --> 00:16:12,777
I told myself

253
00:16:15,777 --> 00:16:16,617
I had to change.

254
00:16:20,938 --> 00:16:23,818
I'm not telling you this

255
00:16:26,777 --> 00:16:28,737
so you'll understand me.

256
00:16:30,338 --> 00:16:31,578
I just want

257
00:16:33,319 --> 00:16:34,613
to be honest with you.

258
00:16:36,641 --> 00:16:37,441
(Secure)
Su.

259
00:16:38,737 --> 00:16:39,737
I'm not a good man.

260
00:16:45,137 --> 00:16:45,737
(Secure)
Let's go.

261
00:17:12,516 --> 00:17:15,588
♪Live by the blade, die by the blade♪

262
00:17:18,862 --> 00:17:21,838
♪Ride the waves
and you may drown in them♪

263
00:17:24,262 --> 00:17:26,862
♪If you gamble your life, go all in♪

264
00:17:26,862 --> 00:17:31,374
♪Leave it to fate. Take it if you dare♪

265
00:17:37,434 --> 00:17:40,114
♪They say every brother has his price♪

266
00:17:40,114 --> 00:17:43,390
♪They say this world swallows you whole♪

267
00:17:44,185 --> 00:17:46,613
♪I won this life on a roll of the dice♪

268
00:17:46,613 --> 00:17:49,685
♪I staked my soul to set myself free♪

269
00:17:50,356 --> 00:17:54,100
♪I was born too tough to break♪

270
00:17:57,319 --> 00:18:01,063
♪Tough enough to walk this road to ruin♪

271
00:18:03,490 --> 00:18:07,522
♪This is my fate. I won't fight it♪

272
00:18:10,337 --> 00:18:13,601
♪I'd rather call my own shots♪

273
00:18:17,087 --> 00:18:19,646
♪Incense fades, but ashes still burn♪

274
00:18:19,646 --> 00:18:22,655
♪Every prayer at the altar rings hollow♪

275
00:18:23,664 --> 00:18:26,190
♪On this long road, never bow your head♪

276
00:18:26,190 --> 00:18:29,454
♪On this road, there's no turning back♪
